Likelihood ratios

Positive likelihood ratio
\[
LR^+
=
\frac{
\text{Sensibilidad}
}{
1 - \text{Especificidad}
}
\]


Negative likelihood ratio
\[
LR^-
=
\frac{
1 - \text{Sensibilidad}
}{
\text{Especificidad}
}
\]
lr_positive = (
    sensitivity
    / (1 - specificity)
)

lr_negative = (
    (1 - sensitivity)
    / specificity
)

