SMAPE
SMAPE intenta reducir algunos problemas de MAPE.
\[
SMAPE =
\frac{100}{n}
\sum_{i=1}^{n}
\frac{
|y_i - \hat{y}_i|
}{
\left(
|y_i| + |\hat{y}_i|
\right)/2
}
\]
import numpy as np

smape = (
    100
    * np.mean(
        2
        * np.abs(
            y_test - y_pred
        )
        / (
            np.abs(y_test)
            + np.abs(y_pred)
        )
    )
)
